  "scope": "Version 3.1.0 adds strict pre-draw scalar validation, profile-compatible domain selection before keyed draws, canonical-scale anchors, executable semantic witnesses/rivals and portable tests. Selected target_code equals unchanged canonical program; archival raw_code is preserved. Reviewer reports 109 tests and 12/12 final battery stages, 300 three-demo/query lessons and 1200 rotations with no declared-rival ambiguities, 1199 unique inputs, and 810 accepted override draws with no findings. Earlier portable-path, diversity and post-draw profile failures remain retained evidence. Landing offsets 2/3 are proposed once per episode, with two complete episodes, four canonical replays and 26 protected Racket evaluations; offset 3 requires active routes of at least three cells. Evidence is finite and reviewer-reported; no variant approval or production parameter API. Source/file bindings and public projections checked statically; runtime outcomes remain reviewer-reported.",
